### 2. Hazard & Recovery Engine

#### [NEW] [backend/app/builder2/hazard_engine.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/backend/app/builder2/hazard_engine.py)
- **Multi-Horizon Hazard Curve**: Generates `List[HazardPoint]` over lead times $t \in [24, 48, 72, 96, 120, 144, 168, 192, 216, 240]$.
- **Survival Function**: Computes $S(t) = \prod_{\tau \le t} (1 - P_{\text{bust}}(\tau))$.
- **Expected Time-to-Bust**: $\mathbb{E}[T_{\text{bust}}] = \sum t \cdot P(T_{\text{bust}} = t)$.
- **Recovery Engine**:
  - Computes probability that a degraded forecast recovers to nominal accuracy at extended leads ($P_{\text{recovery}}$).
  - Determines state transitions: `STABLE → WATCHING → DEGRADING → FAILURE_PRONE → BUST → RECOVERING → STABLE`.
  - Enforces safe abstention transitions when OOD score exceeds threshold or inputs are missing.

