### 4. Trajectory Evaluation Script

#### [NEW] [scripts/evaluate_trajectory_models.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/scripts/evaluate_trajectory_models.py)
- CLI script supporting: `--event-held-out`, `--bootstrap cycle`, `--seed 42`.
- Evaluates multi-horizon trajectories on held-out event chronologies.
- Computes:
  - Lead-stratified Brier score and BSS (short, medium, extended).
  - Survival concordance index.
  - Time-to-bust prediction error (MAE in hours).
  - Recovery state transition accuracy.
  - Cycle-block bootstrap confidence intervals.
- Exports results to `data/evaluation/trajectory_evaluation_results.json`.

